ect, action, and setting. No style words, no quality words, no camera or lens terms.",96,"off",false,true]},{"id":18,"type":"StringReplace","pos":[-1500,1100],"size":[420,200],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"string","name":"string","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"string"},"link":21},{"localized_name":"find","name":"find","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"find"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"replace","name":"replace","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"replace"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[22]}],"title":"去掉模板残留的 assistant 前缀","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"StringReplace"},"widgets_values":["","assistant\n",""]},{"id":12,"type":"Note","pos":[-2101.995234796228,1178.9291115432927],"size":[560,420],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["【怎么用】\n1. 换图 → 节点 1。\n2. 节点 2 的 scale_by 决定成本。Klein 4B 每个 token 每步约 1.94 ms，1 token = 16x16 像素。\n   1 MP  (1024²)  4096 token   4 步 ≈ 32 s\n   4 MP  (2048²) 16384 token   4 步 ≈ 2.1 min\n   9 MP  (3072²) 36864 token   4 步 ≈ 4.8 min\n   16 MP (4096²) 65536 token   4 步 ≈ 8.5 min（显存可能不够，需要分块采样）\n   先从 4 MP 试，确认画质方向再往上加。\n\n【denoise 是唯一要调的旋钮】节点 9\n   0.20–0.25  只加锐度和微纹理，最安全\n   0.28       默认，纹理明显，结构不动\n   0.35       上限。再高会开始改脸和小物件\n   >0.40      会重新发明内容，不要用在补细节上\n\n【提示词】节点 7 只写质感词，不要写画面内容。\n写了名词模型就会去生成它——这是低 denoise 下画面跑偏的主要原因。\n\n【关于放大】节点 2 现在是 lanczos，只是占位。\n放一个 4x-UltraSharp.pth 或 RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth 进 models/upscale_models/，\n换成 UpscaleModelLoader + ImageUpscaleWithModel，画质会明显更好。\n\n【没有用 ReferenceLatent】故意的。接了它 token 数翻倍、耗时翻倍，\n而 img2img 在 denoise 0.28 下本来就保留了 72% 的原图结构，不需要额外参考条件。\n\n【图生提示词：16 + 17】\n16 CLIPLoader 单独加载 qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors（type 随便选，只要不是 flux2，就会走通用 Qwen3-VL 分支，带视觉塔）。\n输入图片 → 17 TextGenerate 读图出一句英文内容描述 → 18 StringReplace 去掉开头的 assistant 前缀 → 14 StringConcatenate 拼上质感词 → 7 正向编码。\n全本地，不需要 API key。代价是多加载一个 ~5GB 的 VLM，第一次跑会慢。\n注意：低 denoise 下写画面名词有跑偏风险。若结果变形，把 17 设为 Bypass(Ctrl+B)，只留质感词。\n\n【新增：15 图像对比】\n左 = 放大后的原图，右 = 补细节结果，同分辨率，拖动滑块看差异。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,0,"IMAGE"],[2,2,0,6,0,"IMAGE"],[3,5,0,6,1,"VAE"],[4,4,0,7,0,"CLIP"],[5,7,0,8,0,"CONDITIONING"],[6,3,0,9,0,"MODEL"],[7,7,0,9,1,"CONDITIONING"],[8,8,0,9,2,"CONDITIONING"],[9,6,0,9,3,"LATENT"],[10,9,0,10,0,"LATENT"],[11,5,0,10,1,"VAE"],[12,10,0,11,0,"IMAGE"],[15,14,0,7,1,"STRING"],[16,2,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[17,10,0,15,1,"IMAGE"],[18,16,0,17,0,"CLIP"],[19,1,0,17,1,"IMAGE"],[21,17,0,18,0,"STRING"],[22,18,0,14,0,"STRING"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.5956196262215769,"offset":[2414.313904288901,-224.59529457477925]}},"version":0.4}